  "notes": "One pinned Node image serves both halves of the build: the sidecar is TypeScript, and node:*-bookworm (not slim) carries the g++ the LD_PRELOAD plugin needs, on the same glibc 2.36 as the Funcom server image — a plugin built on anything newer would fail to preload. The server itself is not run from this image: it is Funcom's own seabass-server image, loaded out of the depot above and tagged 2177228-0-shipping (code branch sb-1.5.20.0, so the database is dune_sb_1_5_20_0). The game client is a different Steam app (1172710) and is not pinned here; the public client of 2026-11-09 (build 26438755) joins this build."
